{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 59, :comments ["<b>Heard</b> — as a sign that they angered Him with words they spoke about Him; therefore: <i>שמע אלהים ויתעבר</i> (\"Elohim heard and was wrath\"), from the root of עברה, that He transgressed the limit of fury." "<b>And rejected</b> — for the destruction of the house of Shiloh was harsh upon all Israel."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 78, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:35:18.383971428Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}